The evaluation is ruled out as the cause: the full input audit passed its gate, and the first test of why long-chunk training lost is now running. Nothing is needed from you except the git push below.

## Done this wake
- **Input audit passed** (a CPU job that rebuilds exactly what the eval feeds the model). It checked 1,500 questions per variant, across 14 variants.
  - The gold answer was never lost to truncation: 0 of 1,500 on documents of 4, 10 and 20 pages, and on 10, 20 and 40 text passages.
  - The compressed model and the uncompressed model got the same documents in the same order on 1,500 of 1,500.
  - The check fails when it should: with chunks cut to 256 tokens, 924 of 1,500 and 275 of 1,500 questions lose the answer.
  - The health number matched: 646,042 compressed slots on the 4-page set, the same as the recorded run.
- **Training never shows the decoder long inputs.** This is only a count, not yet a proven cause:

| input | compressed slots per question, max | questions beyond what finetuning saw |
|---|---|---|
| finetune rows (2,000 sampled) | 488 | — (this is the reference) |
| documents, 4 pages | 485 | 0 / 1,500 |
| documents, 10 pages | 1,208 | 1,500 / 1,500 |
| documents, 20 pages | 2,405 | 1,500 / 1,500 |
| text, 20 passages | 616 | 35 / 1,500 |
| text, 40 passages | 1,035 | 1,498 / 1,500 |

- These tables are in `docs/longdoc_diagnosis.md`. The audit verdict and notes are in the ledger.

## Running now
- **Gold page only, on documents** (the other pages removed), 1,500 questions per model. Four models: the 256-token and 1,024-token stage-1 chains, at both seeds.
- All four are running on homer-017 and should finish around 02:15.
- What it decides: on all 4 pages, the 1,024-token chain scores 6.2 and 4.3 points below the 256-token chain (seeds 42 and 43).
  - If that gap stays at 3 points or more with the gold page alone, the loss is in how each page is compressed.
  - If the gap shrinks to within 2 points, the loss is in reading several pages together.

## Next
- The next wake starts when those four jobs end (at most 3 h). It compares the two chains on the same questions, per seed.
- If the gap stays, it then sends only the page the model itself picks as raw text, to check whether the page pick is the problem.

